1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,425
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,375 --> 00:00:07,420
Maya has a box of jobs.

3
00:00:07,420 --> 00:00:09,175
Wrap this.

4
00:00:09,175 --> 00:00:10,970
Carry that.

5
00:00:10,970 --> 00:00:12,739
Tap this.

6
00:00:12,739 --> 00:00:16,063
But every Eddie in town is busy.

7
00:00:16,063 --> 00:00:18,989
Nobody can carry the box.

8
00:00:18,989 --> 00:00:22,646
Look: Boxy sits on Eddie's head.

9
00:00:22,646 --> 00:00:25,066
Boxy needs an Eddie.

10
00:00:25,066 --> 00:00:26,542
Whoosh!

11
00:00:26,542 --> 00:00:28,682
Fay flies in.

12
00:00:28,682 --> 00:00:31,329
She is a flying box.

13
00:00:31,329 --> 00:00:34,388
She carries the jobs herself.

14
00:00:34,388 --> 00:00:36,755
No Eddie underneath!

15
00:00:36,755 --> 00:00:40,000
The jobs run while she flies.

16
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,388
When the jobs are done, Fay lands and rests.

17
00:00:44,388 --> 00:00:46,582
Eddie can go play.

18
00:00:46,582 --> 00:00:50,359
Nobody pays for an Eddie that sits idle.

19
00:00:50,359 --> 00:00:52,553
That is Fargate.

20
00:00:52,553 --> 00:00:54,773
Now you know Fay!

21
00:00:54,773 --> 00:00:59,468
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

